                    <p class="pad-top1">
                       Activate Booster (Combo*) provides enhanced health coverage for individuals and families. It helps protect you from rising healthcare costs, including in-patient treatment and day care procedures/treatments, ensuring you’re always financially safeguarded. Higher sum insured equals access to best healthcare options without the stress of high out-of-pocket expenses during medical emergencies. Also, this health insurance top up policy with base policy is cost-effective and ensures peace of mind for your family and you. 
                   
                </p></div>
