                            <div class="cp-contentblock">

                                <h6 id="blog3_title1">List of Modern Treatments Covered Under Health Insurance
</h6>
                                <p id="blog3_title2">Modern treatments in health insurance include advanced procedures like robotic surgery, immunotherapy, and stem cell therapy. It explains coverage rules, sub-limits, waiting periods, and documents required to claim expenses under policies based on medical necessity and insurer terms.

</p>
